    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like a space for something new though. it just feels like a hole. like i've been running a race for two decades and i just realized the finish line was a cliff. i'm just so tired of trying to find meaning in a bankrupt life. it feels like the math just doesn't add up anymore.",
